    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. One more thing though—in a high-end law firm, we're really worried about those unexplainable marks, like small chips or sudden surface scratches that don't seem to have a clear cause. Are there any materials that are particularly prone to getting those kinds of weird, random little imperfections from just normal daily use?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
